math.rdn
Copyright (c) 2023-2026 Ray Den
SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT

Purpose:
Math constants and helpers for Raden.

Loading behavior:
This module also loads the native math module through the shared-library suffix:
../nativelibs/math(.so|.dylib|.dll)

Exports:
- sqrt : native square root
- powf : native floating-point power
- pow  : general power helper
- M_E M_LOG2E M_LOG10E M_LN2 M_LN10
- M_PI M_PI_2 M_PI_4
- M_1_PI M_2_PI M_2_SQRTPI
- M_SQRT2 M_SQRT1_2

Stack contracts:
number sqrt call -> result
base exponent powf call -> result
base exponent pow call -> result

Examples:
"./libs/math.rdn" load
4 sqrt call print
"\n" print
2 8 pow call print
*]

"../nativelibs/math" __sharedlib_ext to_string swap pop append loadnative
"Typecheck" load

Math module

    2.7182818284590452354  E		const
    1.4426950408889634074  LOG2E	const
    0.43429448190325182765 LOG10E	const
    0.69314718055994530942 LN2		const
    2.30258509299404568402 LN10		const
    3.14159265358979323846 PI		const
    1.57079632679489661923 PI_2		const
    0.78539816339744830962 PI_4		const
    0.31830988618379067154 1_PI		const
    0.63661977236758134308 2_PI		const
    1.12837916709551257390 2_SQRTPI	const
    1.41421356237309504880 SQRT2	const
    0.70710678118654752440 SQRT1_2	const

    sqrt    (Real) (Real) defun sqrtOf     call end
    pow     (Real) (Real) defun powerOf    call end
    cos     (Real) (Real) defun cosOf      call end
    sin     (Real) (Real) defun sinOf      call end
    arc-sin (Real) (Real) defun asinOf     call end
    arc-cos (Real) (Real) defun acosOf     call end
    arc-tan (Real) (Real) defun atanOf     call end
    tan     (Real) (Real) defun tanOf      call end
    log     (Real) (Real) defun logOf      call end
    log10   (Real) (Real) defun logOf10    call end
    log2    (Real) (Real) defun logOf2     call end

    gcd (Int Int) (Int) defun
        b let
        a let
        0 b = if
            a
            ret
        end
        0 c let
        b 0 != loop
            a b % c set
            b a set
            c b set

            b 0 !=
        end
        a
    end

    @gcd    apply Math::gcd      call end
    @log    apply Math::log      call end
    @log10  apply Math::log10    call end
    @log2   apply Math::log2     call end
    @sqrt   apply Math::sqrt     call end
    @pow    apply Math::pow      call end
    @cos    apply Math::cos      call end
    @acos   apply Math::arc-cos  call end
    @sin    apply Math::sin      call end
    @asin   apply Math::arc-sin  call end
    @tan    apply Math::tan      call end
    @atan   apply Math::arc-tan  call end

end
